WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,800
Ye Xuan, are you back?

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,320
Xuan Ye has not been in Beijing these past few years

3
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:07,480
Always feel like something is missing

4
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:08,400
those ministers

5
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,320
Either you are afraid of me

6
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:10,240
Either to curry favor with me

7
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,480
There is no one like Xuan Ye

8
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,560
Both loyal and capable

9
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:13,680
Still understand my thoughts

10
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:17,380
He is as considerate to Ye Xuan as he was in Chenjiacun

11
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:19,740
