12
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:21,020
I thought the Ai family didn’t know

13
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:22,020
Don't worry

14
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:23,300
As long as Aijia is there

15
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:24,860
No one can take your place away

16
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,500
So what if the enemy is in the palm of his hand?

17
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,700
The Ai family said you are the heir apparent

18
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:28,820
You are the prince

19
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:29,740
Thank you Queen Mother

20
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:32,340
Why are you so polite to the Aijia?

21
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:33,500
That girl Yue'er

22
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,820
But I've always been thinking about you

23
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:35,860
Find a chance for you to have some fun

24
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:36,980
We are young

25
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:38,220
Let’s talk about this in a few years

26
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:40,980
This natural disaster

27
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:42,140
It’s a scene from heaven

28
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,500
Due to His Majesty's misconduct

29
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,860
The time has come

30
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:57,570
Give it to those who are in danger

31
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:01,180
I guarantee that you will melt forever

32
00:01:09,590 --> 00:01:11,030
Now Tianjiang Dahan

33
00:01:11,030 --> 00:01:12,710
According to past practice

34
00:01:12,710 --> 00:01:14,550
The emperor must design an altar outside the city

35
00:01:14,550 --> 00:01:15,990
Pray that God will take over

36
00:01:15,990 --> 00:01:17,710
The Queen Mother currently controls the government

37
00:01:17,710 --> 00:01:20,070
We can definitely wear robes when wearing masks.

38
00:01:20,070 --> 00:01:21,230
Set up an ambush in advance

39
00:01:21,230 --> 00:01:24,030
Taking advantage of the Empress Dowager's departure from the city, he issued an order early and stopped the assassination in one fell swoop.

40
00:01:24,030 --> 00:01:25,870
Anxious for breach of contract No. 3
